OL,3,AHarry Styles extends tour, with Kylie
OL,4,Aas a support act
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery city will see a different support
OL,7,Fact, with 80s pop icons Tears For Fears
OL,8,Fplaying at Wembley, and pop legend
OL,9,FKylie Minogue on the bill in Los
OL,10,FAngeles.
OL,12,FAlthough Minogue is a festival
OL,13,Fheadliner in Europe, these shows will
OL,14,Frepresent her first ever stadium
OL,15,Fconcerts in the US.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
